# rezone clears it; rank 3 at fame 124 (only the fame operand fails): 641; fame 125, rank 2 (only the rank operand
# fails): 642; rank 3: 643 (the Suspicious Envelope, begun). The envelope: his 645; Halver's 549 (the envelope
# deleted, Prog 1). Prog 1 with the envelope back by GM: sections 2 and 3 both hold, and 646 (Progress) wins over 645
# (Event); the envelope taken again: the plans traded at accepted Prog 1 (check 6's status operand fails: nil); 646
# (option [1] the plans) declined, taken (Prog 2). Prog 2: his 647; a chip (nil), the plans with a chip (tradeHas: 648,
# completed: 900 gil, fame +16, the plans taken, the chip kept, Prog cleared). Completed, Prog 0: his 650 declined, taken (Prog 1);
# Prog 1: 647, a chip (nil), the plans (648: Prog 0, the plans taken, 900 gil, fame +16); Prog 0: 650. Completed with
# the envelope by GM (section 2's status operand fails): Halver's default text. Completed, Prog 2 by GM (check 4's status
# operand fails): Dauperiat nothing.
# Dauperiat has no script and no default. Halver's default action (DefaultActions.lua: the text HALVER_OFFSET + 1092)
# answers whenever no quest does, so his script's 577 never plays. No Sandy mission is current (setRank only), so the
# missions naming Halver stay silent.
lists NorthernSanDoria/Dauperiat/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Dauperiat/onTrade NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/641 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/643 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/646 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/648 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/650 ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/549
